pip install -r requirements.txt

uvicorn app:app --reload --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000

## New Endpoint: /youtube/segments

POST /youtube/segments

Request body:

```
{
	"video_id": "<YouTubeVideoID>",
	"query": "optional search query",
	"top_k": 5,
	"refine": false,
	"max_gap": 1.5,
	"min_length": 5,
	"languages": ["en"]
}
```

Response sample (truncated):

```
{
	"video_id": "abc123",
	"sentence_count": 42,
	"sentences": [
		{
			"start": 1.6,
			"end": 5.08,
			"text": "You might have seen machine learning models that take some text and predict whether it is spam or not.",
			"embedding": [0.01, -0.02, ...]
		}
	],
	"query_results": [
		{
			"index": 0,
			"score": 0.81,
			"start": 1.6,
			"end": 5.08,
			"text": "You might have seen machine learning models that take some text and predict whether it is spam or not."
		}
	]
}
```

Notes:

- Embeddings are normalized; similarity uses dot product.
- Set `refine=true` to enable spaCy sentence splitting (requires installing `spacy` and the `en_core_web_sm` model).
- Install transcript dependency: `youtube-transcript-api` (already in requirements).
